hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"505","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), Abu Bakr, Umar aur Usman ke sath Eid al-Fitr mein shirkat ki. Wo use khutbe se pehle parhte, phir baad mein khutba hota. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nikle, goya main Aap ko dekh raha hun jab Aap apne hath se bithate. Phir Aap aage badhe aur unhe cheerte hue aaye yahan tak ke aurton ke paas aaye, Aap ke sath Bilal they. Phir Aap ne farmaya: [Ae Nabi! Jab momin aurtein tumhare paas bai'at ke liye aayein] ayat tak. Phir jab Aap is se farigh hue to farmaya: Kya tum is par ho? To un mein se ek aurat ne kaha, us ke siwa kisi ne Aap ko jawab na diya: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Phir sadqa karo. Phir Bilal ne apna kapda bichhaya. Phir farmaya: Lao, tum par mere maan-baap fida hon. Phir wo angothiyan aur angoothiyan Bilal ke kapde mein dalne lagein."
"506","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Eid al-Fitr ke din khade hue aur namaz parhi. Phir namaz se ibtida ki, phir khutba diya. Phir jab Aap farigh hue to utre aur aurton ke paas aaye aur unhe naseehat ki, jabke Aap Bilal ke hath par tek lagaye they. Aur Bilal ne apna kapda bichhaya tha, aurtein us mein sadqa dalti thein."
"507","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas aur Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhum) se riwayat hai, un dono ne kaha: Eid al-Fitr ke din aur Eid al-Adha ke din azan nahi kahi jati thi."
"508","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn al-Zubair ki taraf bheja, us ke shuru mein jab us ki bai'at ki gayi thi: Beshak Eid al-Fitr ke din namaz ke liye azan nahi kahi jati thi. Aur khutba to namaz ke baad hai."
"509","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar, dono Eidein khutbe se pehle parhte they."
"510","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Eid al-Fitr aur Eid al-Adha ke din Eidgah ki taraf nikalte. Phir sab se pehle jis se ibtida farmate wo namaz hoti. Phir phirte aur logon ke samne khade hote, jabke log apni safon par baithe hote. Phir unhe wa'z farmate, wasiyyat farmate aur hukm farmate. Phir agar Aap lashkar bhejna chahte to bhejte, ya kisi cheez ka hukm farmana chahte to hukm farmate. Phir laut-te. Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Phir log is par rahe yahan tak ke main Marwan ke sath nikla, jo Madina ka ameer tha, Eid al-Adha ya Eid al-Fitr mein. Phir jab hum Eidgah aaye to ek mimbar tha jo Kathir bin al-Salt ne banaya tha. Phir Marwan ne irada kiya ke namaz se pehle us par chadhe. To main ne us ka kapda kheench liya. To us ne mujhe kheench liya. Phir wo upar chadha aur namaz se pehle khutba diya. Phir main ne us se kaha: Allah ki qasam! Tum ne badal diya. To us ne kaha: Ae Abu Sa'id! Jo tum jante ho wo chala gaya. To main ne kaha: Jo main janta hun, Allah ki qasam! Wo us se behtar hai jo main nahi janta. To us ne kaha: Beshak log namaz ke baad hamare liye na baithte they. Phir main ne use namaz se pehle kar diya."
"511","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein hukm diya gaya ke hum haiz waliyon ko dono Eidon ke din nikalein, aur parda-nasheen kunwariyon ko. Phir wo Musalmanon ki jamaat aur dua mein hazir hon. Aur haiz waliyan apni namaz ki jagah se alag rahein. Ek aurat ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Hum mein se ek ke paas jilbab nahi hai. Aap ne farmaya: Us ki saheli use apne jilbab mein se pehnaye."
"512","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr dakhil hue jabke mere paas Ansar ki londiyon mein se do londiyan thein, wo Bu'ath ke din Ansar ne jo kaha tha use ga rahi thein. Unhon ne kaha: Aur wo dono ganewali na thein. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Kya shaitan ke mizmar Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ghar mein? Aur ye Eid ke din tha. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Bakr! Har qaum ki Eid hoti hai aur ye hamari Eid hai."
"513","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mere paas dakhil hue jabke mere paas do londiyan Bu'ath ke geet ga rahi thein. Phir Aap bistar par let gaye aur apna chehra pher liya. Aur Abu Bakr dakhil hue to unhon ne mujhe danta aur kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas shaitan ka mizmar? Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: Unhe chhor do. Phir jab wo ghafil hue to main ne unhe ishara kiya aur wo dono niklein. Aur Eid ka din tha jis mein Habshi dhalon aur nezon se khel rahe they. Phir ya main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha, ya Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum dekhna chahti ho? To main ne arz kiya: Haan. Phir Aap ne mujhe apne peechhe khada kiya, mera rukhsar Aap ke rukhsar par, jabke Aap farma rahe they: Lo ae Bani Arfida! Yahan tak ke jab main ukta gayi to Aap ne farmaya: Kafi hai? Main ne arz kiya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Phir jao."
"514","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Habshi Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas apne nezon se khel rahe they to Umar dakhil hue. Phir unhon ne kankariyon ki taraf hath badhaya aur unhe un se mara. To Aap ne farmaya: Unhe chhor do ae Umar!"
